{
    "chapter_num": 5,
    "verses_count": 26,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Christian Liberty"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Stand"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU For freedom Christ has made us free; stand fast therefore, and"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " fast therefore in the liberty by which Christ has made us free, and do not be entangled again with a yoke of bondage. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Indeed I, Paul, say to you that if you become circumcised, Christ will profit you nothing. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And I testify again to every man who becomes circumcised that he is "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "obligated"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "a debtor to keep the whole law. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "You have become estranged from Christ, you who "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "attempt to"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " be justified by law; you have fallen from grace. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For we through the Spirit eagerly wait for the hope of righteousness by faith. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For in Christ Jesus neither circumcision nor uncircumcision avails anything, but faith working through love."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Love Fulfills the Law"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "You ran well. Who hindered you from obeying the truth? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "This persuasion does not "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "come"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " from Him who calls you. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "A little leaven leavens the whole lump. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "I have confidence in you, in the Lord, that you will have no other mind; but he who troubles you shall bear his judgment, whoever he is."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And I, brethren, if I still preach circumcision, why do I still suffer persecution? Then the offense of the cross has ceased. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "I could wish that those who trouble you would even "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "mutilate themselves"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "cut themselves off!"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For you, brethren, have been called to liberty; only do not "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "use"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " liberty as an opportunity for the flesh, but through love serve one another. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For all the law is fulfilled in one word, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "even"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in this: "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "“You shall love your neighbor as yourself.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But if you bite and devour one another, beware lest you be consumed by one another!"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Walking in the Spirit"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "I say then: Walk in the Spirit, and you shall not fulfill the lust of the flesh. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For the flesh lusts against the Spirit, and the Spirit against the flesh; and these are contrary to one another, so that you do not do the things that you wish. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But if you are led by the Spirit, you are not under the law."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now the works of the flesh are evident, which are: "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU omits adultery"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "adultery, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "sexual immorality"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "fornication, uncleanness, lewdness, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "idolatry, sorcery, hatred, contentions, jealousies, outbursts of wrath, selfish ambitions, dissensions, heresies, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "envy, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU omits murders"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "murders, drunkenness, revelries, and the like; of which I tell you beforehand, just as I also told "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "you"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in time past, that those who practice such things will not inherit the kingdom of God."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 22,
                    "num_str": "22",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But the fruit of the Spirit is love, joy, peace, longsuffering, kindness, goodness, faithfulness, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 23,
                    "num_str": "23",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "meekness"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "gentleness, self-control. Against such there is no law. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 24,
                    "num_str": "24",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And those "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "who are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Christ’s have crucified the flesh with its passions and desires. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 25,
                    "num_str": "25",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "If we live in the Spirit, let us also walk in the Spirit. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 26,
                    "num_str": "26",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Let us not become conceited, provoking one another, envying one another."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}